---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Hero from '../components/ui/Hero.astro';
import { responsive } from '../lib/responsive';
import { formatDate } from '../lib/format';
import { REGISTERED_NAME, ARN, TAGLINE } from '../lib/distributor';

// Set to the date the wording last changed, not the build date.
const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-10-20';

const lightLink = 'text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-link font-medium underline';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - Fund Investigator"
  description="Terms of Service for Fund Investigator: site use, investment research, and important disclaimers."
>
  <Hero size="sm" centered={false}>
    <h1 class:list={[responsive.display, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-4 leading-tight']}>
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class:list={[responsive.subtitle, 'text-fi-muted']}>
      Last updated: {formatDate(LAST_UPDATED)}
    </p>
  </Hero>

  <Section background="white" spacing="md" maxWidth="md">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-fi-muted space-y-8">

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6']}>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using Fund Investigator, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provisions of this agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>2. What We Offer</h2>
        {/* #65 / review must-have 4 (2026-10-20 draft, pending compliance review): "information
            only" is scoped to the public content; the distribution service is described as on
            /invest/ and /disclosures/. */}
        <p>
          Fund Investigator has two parts. This website publishes guides, investigations and tools that give general educational information about mutual funds. They do not consider your personal circumstances and are not investment advice or a recommendation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Separately, {REGISTERED_NAME}, an {TAGLINE} ({ARN}), offers a distribution service, <a href="/invest/" class={lightLink}>Invest with support</a>. It starts with a 30-minute introductory call at no charge. If you choose to go ahead, it covers fact-finding, risk profiling and a suitability assessment, a scheme shortlist prepared for you, help to invest in Regular Plans, and reviews at agreed intervals. Investments made through us may earn us commission from the relevant AMC. Our distributor relationship, commission and product universe are described on our <a href="/disclosures/" class={lightLink}>Disclosures</a> page.
        </p>
        <p>
          Booking a call or contacting us does not make you a client or oblige you to invest. Every investment decision is yours.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>3. Data and Information</h2>
        <p>
          Fund NAV data may be sourced from AMFI. Benchmark data may be sourced from NSE Indices or other identified index providers. Scheme attributes, portfolios and manager information may be sourced from AMC factsheets, portfolio disclosures, SID/KIM documents and other official publications. Regulatory information may be sourced from SEBI and AMFI. Fund Investigator may calculate derived metrics from these sources. The source and calculation period are identified in each applicable report. While we strive for accuracy, we make no warranties about the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of this information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>4. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The analysis and metrics in our public guides, investigations and tools are general information. They should not be considered as investment advice or recommendations for you. Past performance does not guarantee future results. See our <a href="/disclaimer/" class={lightLink}>Disclaimer</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Fund Investigator shall not be liable for any investment decisions made based on the general information published on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>6. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@fundinvestigator.com" class="text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-link font-medium">contact@fundinvestigator.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
